# The eye test for the TONE SLOT: this file is the ONLY copy, and every decorator
# below dresses it differently.
#
#   @{view:table}                 the @tone default, key
#   @{view:table, type:warning}   yellow, and the message still says what it is
#   @{view:table, type:error}     red
#   @{view:table tone:gold}       gold, no comma, no semantics
#
# The bar and the label spend the same class, so a tone changes the whole accent.
@tone key
@fields rows label content
@each rows cap="1/3"
 {{tone}}▎{{/}} {{tone}}${label}{{/}}  ${content}
@end
